      "date": "2026-01-30T12:06:40.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter dividend of ₹2.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹2.00. Ex-date: 3rd February 2026 Payment date: 27th February 2026 Dividend yield will be 1.3%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.5%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by earnings (49% earnings payout ratio) but the company has no free cash flows available, indicating it may be using cash reserves or debt to pay the dividend. The dividend has increased by an average of 6.4% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 40% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
