      "date": "2026-01-29T11:29:53.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹4.05 (vs ₹1.37 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.05 (up from ₹1.37 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.79b (down 26% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹270.0m (up ₹370.0m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by lower expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 3.9% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Consumer Durables industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 3% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
